{"ref":"BDB, עָקֹב","hw":"עָקֹב","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָקֹב</span></big>  <strong>adj. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong> insidious, deceitful</strong>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.9\">Je 17:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">עָקֹב הַלֵּב מִכֹּל</span>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> foot-tracked (</strong>denom. from i. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָקֵב</span><strong>)</strong> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:8\" href=\"/Hosea.6.8\">Ho 6:8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּלְעָד קִרְיַת פֹּעֲלֵי אָוֶן עֲקֻבָּה מִדָּם</span>.","next":"BDB, עָקֹב²","prev":"BDB, עָקֵב²"}